.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4883:
	.ascii	"sh:path"
	.size	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4883, 7

	.type	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4884,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4884,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4884:
	.ascii	"A property shape whose path is not one predicate (an inverse, sequence, alternative or closure path) constrains no outgoing JSON property of the projected node, so the property shape is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4884, 194

	.type	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4885,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4885,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4885:
	.ascii	"sh:property"
	.size	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4885, 11

	.type	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4886,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4886,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4886:
	.ascii	"A property shape nested under a property shape or a member shape judges each value node's (or member's) own properties, which live on that node's own @graph node; a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it, so none reaches them, and the nested shape is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4886, 309

	.type	.Lanon.613f6dc44e7c5dae8ce40a9bc4110ef5.4887,@object
